function aboutGame(){const p=storyDialog('About Ghost Shift','<span class="eyebrow">A DATA PROTECTION INVESTIGATION</span><h2>Follow the data. Protect the people.</h2><p>Ghost Shift: Midnight Breach is a single-player mystery set in a Mumbai office after midnight. You are Simon Ghost Riley, the appointed Data Protection Officer. A suspicious export connects incidents across four departments, and the records do not tell the same story.</p><h3>What you do</h3><p>Explore floors 47–50, inspect evidence on each case desk, speak to colleagues and decide how the organisation should respond. Preserve records, coordinate containment, verify authority and consider the people affected. You investigate and advise as a DPO.</p><h3>What it is for</h3><p>The game helps players practise careful reasoning about personal data: purpose and consent, access and disclosure, individual rights, accuracy, retention, vendor oversight and incident response. Close answer choices make you weigh timing, scope and accountability instead of guessing from wording.</p><h3>Your goal</h3><p>Reconstruct the Blue Lantern export trail and make decisions you can defend at dawn. Your decisions affect points, integrity, warnings and the ending. At least 80% correct unlocks the heroic outcome. Untimed play and a guided tutorial are available in Shift Options.</p><button class="primary story-close">BACK TO MAIN MENU</button>');if(p)p.dialog.querySelector('.story-close').onclick=p.close;}

